OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews remain at nature
OL,4,Areserve blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews are damping down hotspots at
OL,7,Fa renowned nature reserve after a blaze
OL,8,Fdamaged gorse and woodland.
OL,10,FAt its height, 40 firefighters attended
OL,11,Fthe blaze at Cley Marshes on the north
OL,12,FNorfolk coast, near the A149, after the
OL,13,Ffire service was alerted at 14:25 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FCrews from 13 stations across the
OL,17,Fcounty were sent to the scene, while
OL,18,Frelief teams worked through the night
OL,19,Fto bring the blaze under control and
OL,20,Fprevent it from spreading.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
