OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews remain at nature
OL,4,Areserve blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a social media update, Norfolk Fire
OL,7,Fand Rescue Service said it was "scaling
OL,8,Fback" the incident, but would "continue
OL,9,Fto have a presence on scene all day
OL,10,Fdamping down hotspots".
